      "id": "5f6f9cf6761a-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If (4x - 7y) 2 + (5y - 3z) 2 = 0, then find x : y : z = ? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (4x - 7y) 2 + (5y - 3z) 2 = 0, &#2340;&#2379; x : y : z = ? &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If (4x  -  7y)<sup>2 </sup>+ (5y  -  3z)<sup>2</sup> = 0, then find x : y : z = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (4x - 7y)<sup>2 </sup>+ (5y - 3z)<sup>2</sup> = 0, &#2340;&#2379; x : y : z = ? &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "21 : 20 : 15 21 : 20 : 15",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">21 : 20 : 15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">21 : 20 : 15</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "21 : 12 : 20 21 : 12 : 20",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">21 : 12 : 20</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">21 : 12 : 20</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "22 : 21 : 20 22 : 21 : 20",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">22 : 21 : 20</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">22 : 21 : 20</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "21 : 20 : 12 21 : 20 : 12",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">21 : 20 : 12</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">21 : 20 : 12</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>If a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>=&gt; a = 0 and b = 0</p><p>(4x  -  7y)<sup>2</sup> + (5y  -  3z)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>4x  -  7y = 0</p><p>4x = 7y</p><p>x : y = 7 : 4........(i)</p><p>5y  -  3z = 0</p><p>5y = 3z</p><p>y : z = 3 : 5.......(ii)</p><p>multiply eq(i) by 3 and eq(ii) by 4 we get,</p><p>x : y : z = 21 : 12 : 20</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5f6f9cf6761a-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "If a 2 + b 2 + c 2 + 266 = 2 (9a + 8b - 11c), then (ab - bc - ca) - 128 is : &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a 2 + b 2 + c 2 + 266 = 2 (9a + 8b - 11c), &#2340;&#2379; (ab - bc - ca) - 128 &#2361;&#2376;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2 </sup>+ 266 = 2 (9a + 8b  -  11c), then (ab  -  bc  -  ca)  -  128 is :</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2 </sup>+ 266 = 2 (9a + 8b - 11c), &#2340;&#2379; (ab - bc - ca) - 128 &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "156 156",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">156</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">156</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "343 343",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">343</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">343</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "131 131",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">131</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">131</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "243 243",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">243</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">243</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 266 = 2(9a + 8b  -  11c)</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 266 = 18a + 16b  -  22c</p><p>a<sup>2</sup>  -  18a + b<sup>2</sup>  -  16b + c<sup>2</sup> + 22c + 266 = 0</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> -18a + 81 + b<sup>2</sup> + 64  -  16b + c<sup>2</sup> + 121 + 22c = 0</p><p>(a  -  9)<sup>2</sup> + (b  -  8)<sup>2</sup> + (c + 11)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>a = 9, b = 8 and c = -11</p><p>(ab  -  bc  -  ca)  -  128 = (9*8  -  (8 * -11)  -  (-11 * 9)  -  128</p><p>=&gt; (72 + 88 + 99)  -  128 = 259  -  128</p><p>=&gt; 131</p>",
      "images": [],
