    {
      "id": "5f6f9cf6761a-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "If 25x 2 + 4y 2 + 4z 2 = 4 (5x - y + 6z) - 41, then the value of (xy + 2z) is : &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 25x 2 + 4y 2 + 4z 2 = 4 (5x - y + 6z) - 41, &#2340;&#2379; (xy + 2z) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 25x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4z<sup>2</sup> = 4 (5x  -  y + 6z)  -  41, then the value of (xy + 2z) is :</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 25x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4z<sup>2</sup> = 4 (5x - y + 6z) - 41, &#2340;&#2379; (xy + 2z) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "28/5 28/5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">28/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">28/5</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "15/7 15/7",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">15/7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15/7</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "29/5 29/5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">29/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">29/5</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "32/5 32/5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">32/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">32/5</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>25x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4z<sup>2</sup> = 4(5x  -  y + 6z)  -  41</p><p>=&gt; 25x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4z<sup>2</sup>  -  20x + 4y  -  24z + 41= 0</p><p>=&gt; (5x)<sup>2</sup>  -  2*5x * 2 + 2<sup>2</sup> + (2y)<sup>2</sup> + 2 * 2y * 1 + 1<sup>2</sup> + (2z)<sup>2</sup>  -  2 * 2z * 6 + 6<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>(5x  -  2)<sup>2</sup> + (2y + 1)<sup>2</sup> + (2z  -  6)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>(5x  -  2)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>5x  -  2 = 0</p><p>x = 2/5</p><p>similarly,</p><p>y = -1/2 and z = 3</p><p>(xy + 2z) = 2/5 * (-1/2) + 2 * 3 = 29/5</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
