      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5f6f9cf6761a-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "If 7 a = 11 b = 77 c , then find the value of c = ? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 7 a = 11 b = 77 c , &#2340;&#2379; c &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; = ?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 7<sup>a</sup> = 11<sup>b</sup> = 77<sup>c</sup>, then find the value of c = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 7<sup>a</sup> = 11<sup>b</sup> = 77<sup>c</sup>, &#2340;&#2379; c &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; = ?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1/a - a/b + 1/c = 0 1/a - a/b + 1/c = 0",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1/a  -  a/b + 1/c = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/a  -  a/b + 1/c = 0</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1/a - 1/b - 1/c = 0 1/a - 1/b - 1/c = 0",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1/a  -  1/b  -  1/c = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/a  -  1/b  -  1/c = 0</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1/a + 1/b + 1/c = 0 1/a + 1/b + 1/c = 0",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1/a + 1/b + 1/c = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/a + 1/b + 1/c = 0</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1/a + 1/b - 1/c = 0 1/a + 1/b - 1/c = 0",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1/a + 1/b  -  1/c = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/a + 1/b  -  1/c = 0</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>7<sup>a</sup> = 11<sup>b</sup> = 77<sup>c</sup></p><p>Let 7<sup>a</sup> = 11<sup>b</sup> = 77<sup>c</sup> = k</p><p>7 = k<sup>1/a</sup>............(i)</p><p>11 = k<sup>1/b</sup>............(ii)</p><p>77 = k<sup>1/c</sup>...........(iii)</p><p>7 * 11 = 77</p><p>k<sup>1/a</sup> * k<sup>1/b</sup> = k<sup>1/c</sup>............using eq(i), (ii) and (iii)</p><p>k<sup>1/A</sup> <sup>+ 1/B</sup> = k<sup>1/C</sup></p><p>1/a + 1/b = 1/c</p><p>1/a + 1/b  -  1/c = 0</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
