      "number": 6,
      "question": "If x + y + z = 3, xy + yz + zx = -4 and xyz = -4, then (x 3 + y 3 + z 3 ) is equal to ______ . &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x + y + z = 3, xy + yz + zx = -4 &#2324;&#2352; xyz = -4 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (x 3 + y 3 + z 3 ) &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x + y + z = 3, xy + yz + zx = -4 and xyz = -4, then (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup>) is equal to ______ .</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x + y + z = 3, xy + yz + zx = -4 &#2324;&#2352; xyz = -4 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup>) &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "60 60",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">60</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">60</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "62 62",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">62</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">62</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "51 51",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">51</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">51</span>"
        },
        {
