      "question": "If &#945; + &#946; + &#947; = 0, then (5&#946; 2 + 2&#945; 2 + &#947; 2 )/( 6&#946; 2 + 3&#945; 2 + 2&#945;&#946;) = ? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#945; + &#946; + &#947; = 0, &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; (5&#946; 2 + 2&#945; 2 + &#947; 2 )/( 6&#946; 2 + 3&#945; 2 + 2&#945;&#946;) = ?",
