      "question": "If x = 120, y = 122, z = 118, then find the value of x 3 + y 3 + z 3 - 3xyz. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = 120, y = 122, z = 118, &#2340;&#2379; x 3 + y 3 + z 3 - 3xyz &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x = 120, y = 122, z = 118, then find the value of x<sup>3 </sup>+ y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup>  -  3xyz.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = 120, y = 122, z = 118, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>3 </sup>+ y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "4020 4020",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">4020</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4020</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "4320 4320",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">4320</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4320</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4510 4510",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">4510</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4510</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "4810 4810",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">4810</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4810</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = (x + y + z)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx)</p><p>If x + y + z = 0, then x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = 0</p><p><b>Calculation:</b></p><p>We have,</p><p>=&gt; x = 120, y = 122, z = 118</p><p>=&gt; x + y + z = 120 + 122 + 118 = 360</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = (x + y + z)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx)</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> = 120<sup>2</sup> = 14400</p><p>=&gt; y<sup>2</sup> = 122<sup>2</sup> = 14884</p><p>=&gt; z<sup>2</sup> = 118<sup>2</sup> = 13924</p><p>=&gt; xy = 120  X  122 = 14640</p><p>=&gt; yz = 122  X  118 = 14396</p><p>=&gt; zx = 118  X  120 = 14160</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx = 14400 + 14884 + 13924 - 14640 - 14396 - 14160</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx = 43208 - 43196</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx = 12</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = 360  X  12</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = 4320</p>",
