      "question": "If 4a + 4b + c = 0, then find the value of (9a 2 + 9b 2 + 9c 2 )/(5c 2 - 18ab). &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 4a + 4b + c = 0, &#2340;&#2379; (9a 2 + 9b 2 + 9c 2 )/(5c 2 - 18ab) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 4a + 4b + c = 0, then find the value of (9a<sup>2</sup> + 9b<sup>2</sup> + 9c<sup>2</sup>)/(5c<sup>2</sup>  -  18ab).</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 4a + 4b + c = 0, &#2340;&#2379; (9a<sup>2</sup> + 9b<sup>2</sup> + 9c<sup>2</sup>)/(5c<sup>2</sup> - 18ab) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "0.25 0.25",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">0.25</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.25</span>"
