        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1 1",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "0.5 0.5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">0.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.5</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Let c = 0</p><p>Then,</p><p>4a = -4b</p><p>a = -b</p><p>putting value of a and c in (9a<sup>2</sup> + 9b<sup>2</sup> + 9c<sup>2</sup>)/(5c<sup>2</sup>  -  18ab) we get,</p><p>[9(-b)<sup>2</sup> + 9b<sup>2</sup> + 9*(0)<sup>2</sup>]/[5(0)<sup>2</sup>  -  18(-b)b)</p><p>=&gt; (9b<sup>2</sup> + 9b<sup>2</sup>)/18b<sup>2</sup> = 18b<sup>2</sup>/18b<sup>2</sup> = 1</p>",
