    {
      "id": "5f6f9cf6761a-q11",
      "number": 11,
      "question": "If a/b + b/c + c/a = 28 and b/a + c/b + a/c = 7, then find the value of a 2 /b 2 + b 2 /c 2 + c 2 /a 2 ? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a/b + b/c + c/a = 28 &#2324;&#2352; b/a + c/b + a/c = 7 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; a 2 /b 2 + b 2 /c 2 + c 2 /a 2 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a/b + b/c + c/a = 28 and b/a + c/b + a/c = 7, then find the value of a<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>/c<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>/a<sup>2</sup> ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a/b + b/c + c/a = 28 &#2324;&#2352; b/a + c/b + a/c = 7 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; a<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>/c<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>/a<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "680 680",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">680</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">680</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "770 770",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">770</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">770</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "720 720",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">720</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">720</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "700 700",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">700</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">700</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Let a/b = x, b/c = y and c/a = z</p><p>xyz = 1 (as the products of the ratios cycle back to 1)</p><p>x + y + z = 28............(i)</p><p>1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 7</p><p>(yz + zx + xy)/xyz = 7</p><p>yz + zx + xy = 7........(ii)</p><p>a<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup>+ b<sup>2</sup>/c<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>/a<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup></p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2 </sup>= (x + y + z)<sup>2</sup>  -  2(xy + yz + zx)</p><p>putting values from (i) and (ii) we get,</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2 </sup>= (28)<sup>2</sup>  -  2(7)</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = 784  -  14</p><p>a<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>/c<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>/a<sup>2 </sup>= 770</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
