      "question": "If a 2 + b 2 + c 2 = ab + bc + ca, then find the value of (25a 4 + 15b 4 + 18c 4 )/(128a 2 b 2 + 56b 2 c 2 + 48c 2 a 2 ) is : &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a 2 + b 2 + c 2 = ab + bc + ca, &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; (25a 4 + 15b 4 + 18c 4 )/(128a 2 b 2 + 56b 2 c 2 + 48c 2 a 2 ) &#2361;&#2376;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = ab + bc + ca, then find the value of</p><p>(25a<sup>4</sup> + 15b<sup>4</sup> + 18c<sup>4</sup>)/(128a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + 56b<sup>2</sup>c<sup>2</sup> + 48c<sup>2</sup>a<sup>2</sup>) is :</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = ab + bc + ca, &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;</p><p>(25a<sup>4</sup> + 15b<sup>4</sup> + 18c<sup>4</sup>)/(128a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + 56b<sup>2</sup>c<sup>2</sup> + 48c<sup>2</sup>a<sup>2</sup>) &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "4 4",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1 1",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "0.5 0.5",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">0.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.5</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "0.25 0.25",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">0.25</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.25</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = ab + bc + ca</p><p>(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> + (b  -  c)<sup>2</sup> + (c  -  a)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>a = b = c</p><p>let a = b = c = k then,</p><p>25a<sup>4</sup> + 15b<sup>4</sup> + 18c<sup>4</sup> = 25k<sup>4</sup> + 15k<sup>4</sup> + 18k<sup>4</sup> = 58k<sup>4</sup></p><p>128a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + 56b<sup>2</sup>c<sup>2</sup> + 48c<sup>2</sup>a<sup>2</sup> = 128k<sup>4</sup> + 56k<sup>4</sup> + 48k<sup>4</sup> = 232k<sup>4</sup></p><p>(25a<sup>4</sup> + 15b<sup>4</sup> + 18c<sup>4</sup>)/(128a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + 56b<sup>2</sup>c<sup>2</sup> + 48c<sup>2</sup>a<sup>2</sup>) = 58/232</p><p>=&gt; 58/232 = 1/4 or 0.25</p>",
