      "solution": "<p>4x<sup>2</sup>/yz  -  y<sup>2</sup>/2xz + 27z<sup>2</sup>/2xy</p><p>8x<sup>3</sup>  -  y<sup>3</sup> + 27z<sup>3</sup>/2xyz</p><p>Given that 2x  -  y + 3z = 0</p><p>We know that if a + b + c = 0, then a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> = 3abc</p><p>So, [(2x)<sup>3</sup>  -  y<sup>3</sup> + (3z)<sup>3</sup>]/2xyz</p><p>[3(2x)(-y)(3z)]/2xyz = -18/2</p><p>-9</p>",
