      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> - 3abc = (a + b + c)/2  X  [(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> + (b  -  c)<sup>2</sup> + (c  -  a)<sup>2</sup>]</p><p>[(a-b)<sup>2</sup>+(b-c)<sup>2</sup>+(c-a)<sup>2</sup>]/[(a<sup>3</sup>+b<sup>3</sup>+c<sup>3</sup>-3abc)] = [(a-b)<sup>2</sup>+(b-c)<sup>2</sup>+(c-a)<sup>2</sup>]/{(a + b + c)/2  X  [(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> + (b  -  c)<sup>2</sup> + (c  -  a)<sup>2</sup>]}</p><p>=&gt; 2/(a + b + c) = 2/(408  -  188  -  184) = 2/36</p><p>=&gt; 1/18</p>",
