      "question": "If (a 3 +b 3 +c 3 -3abc) = 330, and (a+b+c) = 11, find the value of (a-b) 2 +(b-c) 2 +(c-a) 2 . &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (a 3 +b 3 +c 3 -3abc) = 330, &#2324;&#2352; (a+b+c) = 11, &#2340;&#2379; (a-b) 2 +(b-c) 2 +(c-a) 2 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If (a<sup>3</sup>+b<sup>3</sup>+c<sup>3</sup>-3abc) = 330, and (a+b+c) = 11, find the value of (a-b)<sup>2</sup>+(b-c)<sup>2</sup>+(c-a)<sup>2</sup>.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (a<sup>3</sup>+b<sup>3</sup>+c<sup>3</sup>-3abc) = 330, &#2324;&#2352; (a+b+c) = 11, &#2340;&#2379; (a-b)<sup>2</sup>+(b-c)<sup>2</sup>+(c-a)<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
