      "id": "5f6f9cf6761a-q17",
      "number": 17,
      "question": "If a - b - c = 0, then [(a 2 + b 2 + c 2 )/(b 2 + ac)] 4 = ? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a - b - c = 0, &#2340;&#2379; [(a 2 + b 2 + c 2 )/(b 2 + ac)] 4 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a  -  b  -  c = 0, then [(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac)]<sup>4</sup> = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a - b - c = 0, &#2340;&#2379; [(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac)]<sup>4</sup> = ?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "4 4",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "8 8",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "16 16",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>a  -  b  -  c = 0</p><p>a  -  c = b</p><p>squaring both sides we get,</p><p>(a  -  c)<sup>2</sup> = b<sup>2</sup></p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  2ac = b<sup>2</sup></p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = b<sup>2</sup> + 2ac</p><p>by adding b<sup>2</sup> to both sides we get,</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = 2b<sup>2</sup> + 2ac</p><p>(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac) = 2</p><p>[(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac)]<sup>4 </sup>= 2<sup>4</sup></p><p>=&gt; 16</p>",
