    {
      "id": "5f6f9cf6761a-q18",
      "number": 18,
      "question": "If x + y + z = xyz = 1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1, then find x 3 + y 3 + z 3 + 5. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x + y + z = xyz = 1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1, &#2340;&#2379; x 3 + y 3 + z 3 + 5 &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x + y + z = xyz = 1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1, then find x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> + 5.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x + y + z = xyz = 1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> + 5 &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1 1",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4 4",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "6 6",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>Formula used :</p><p>(x + y + z)<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2(xy + yz + zx)</p><p>And x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = (x + y + z) * (x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup>  -  xy  -  yz  -  zx) + 3xyz</p><p>Given,</p><p>1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1</p><p>(yz + xz + xy)/xyz = 1</p><p>(yz+ xz + xy) = 1</p><p>x + y + z = 1</p><p>squaring both sides,</p><p>(x + y + z)<sup>2</sup> = 1<sup>2</sup></p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2(xy + yz + zx) = 1</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2 * 1 = 1</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = 1  -  2 = - 1</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup><sub> </sub>= (x + y + z) * (x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup>  -  xy  -  yz  -  zx) + 3xyz</p><p>=&gt; 1 * (-1  -  1) + 3 = -2 + 3 = 1</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> + 5 = 1 + 5 = 6</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
