      "solution": "<p>[(4a  -  9)/a]  -  [(5b  -  9)/b] + [(3c + 9)/c] = 0</p><p>On taking a, b and c as common from the respective terms</p><p>=&gt; [a(4  -  9/a)/a]  -  [b(5  -  9/b)/b] + [c(3 + 9/c)/c] = 0</p><p>(4  -  9/a)  -  (5  -  9/b) + (3 + 9/c) = 0</p><p>4  -  5 + 3 = 9a  -  9/b  -  9/c</p><p>1/a  -  1/b  -  1/c = 2/9</p>",
